eft below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+15 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +15 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>, <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Parrying\" title=\"Parrying\">Parrying +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Parrying\" title=\"Parrying\">Parrying +6</a>:</b> +6 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>, +6 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to Saves.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Doublestrike\" title=\"Doublestrike\"> Doublestrike 16%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Doublestrike\" title=\"Doublestrike\"> Doublestrike 16%</a>:</b> Passive: 16% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Doublestrike. (Doublestrike is a chance to score an additional hit with a melee attack.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Guardbreaking\" title=\"Guardbreaking\">Guardbreaking</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Guardbreaking\" title=\"Guardbreaking\">Guardbreaking</a>:</b> This item enables you to break an enemy's guard in between your melee attacks. On critical hits with your melee weapons, enemies will become <a href=\"/page/Dazed\" title=\"Dazed\">dazed</a> as a result.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Insightful Dexterity +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Insightful Dexterity +6</a></b>: This item makes the wearer more nimble and dexterous, granting a +6 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to Dexterity.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.purple>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Purple\"]{background-c